  "title": "Advancing and scoring",
  "intro": "Agendas are how the Corp wins. Install one into a remote, spend clicks and credits advancing it, and once it has as many advancement tokens as its advancement requirement, score it. Offworld Office needs 4 and is worth 2 points; scoring it also pays you 7 credits. Six points win the starter game.\n\nYou installed it and advanced it once last turn. This lesson: advance it to 4 and score.",
